# Used instead of the root .dockerignore when building api/Dockerfile (BuildKit
# looks for <Dockerfile>.dockerignore). Sends api/ minus everything the running
# API doesn't need, so new app modules are included automatically.
*
!api/
api/tests
api/seed
api/db
api/*.md
api/.env*
api/pytest.ini
api/requirements-dev.txt
api/Dockerfile*
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
